WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.187
Jensen Huang ran Nvidia for

00:00:01.987 --> 00:00:03.396
thirty-three years.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.761
On Thursday its co-founder resigned,

00:00:05.561 --> 00:00:07.050
effective immediately.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.451
Finance chief Colette Kress now

00:00:10.251 --> 00:00:12.489
runs Nvidia as interim CEO

00:00:12.289 --> 00:00:14.064
and keeps her CFO job.

00:00:14.104 --> 00:00:16.088
Harvey Jones becomes its first

00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:17.049
ever board chair.

00:00:17.599 --> 00:00:19.316
On Sunday the board opened

00:00:19.116 --> 00:00:21.454
an investigation into reports Huang

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.867
was targeted by foreign intelligence,

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:24.694
and backed him.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:27.042
On Wednesday a second relationship

00:00:26.842 --> 00:00:27.789
was reported.

00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:29.273
Thursday, he resigned.

00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:31.636
The reports cited a US

00:00:31.436 --> 00:00:33.845
memo saying an executive Huang

00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:35.713
was involved with was seen

00:00:35.513 --> 00:00:37.412
by US intelligence as a

00:00:37.212 --> 00:00:38.686
Chinese spy asset.

00:00:38.726 --> 00:00:41.795
China calls the allegations unsubstantiated.

00:00:42.345 --> 00:00:43.798
Shares fell as much as

00:00:43.598 --> 00:00:45.679
thirteen percent in the opening

00:00:45.479 --> 00:00:48.047
minutes, pushing Nvidia's value below

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.371
four trillion dollars.

00:00:49.921 --> 00:00:52.009
The filing shows no severance,

00:00:51.809 --> 00:00:54.099
and the investigation's findings are

00:00:53.899 --> 00:00:54.706
not public.

00:00:54.746 --> 00:00:56.426
Treat any claim about them

00:00:56.226 --> 00:00:57.301
as unconfirmed.

00:00:57.851 --> 00:00:59.555
Nothing you build on changes

00:00:59.355 --> 00:01:00.056
this week.

00:01:00.096 --> 00:01:02.828
Watch earnings on November seventeenth,

00:01:02.628 --> 00:01:05.156
and Washington, where lawmakers want

00:01:04.956 --> 00:01:06.114
Huang to testify.

00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:07.806
And check how hard leaving

00:01:07.606 --> 00:01:08.664
Nvidia would be.

00:01:09.214 --> 00:01:10.492
The chips are fine.

00:01:10.532 --> 00:01:12.121
The next CEO inherits a

00:01:11.921 --> 00:01:14.762
political problem, not an engineering one.

00:01:15.312 --> 00:01:16.719
Read the full story on

00:01:16.519 --> 00:01:17.457
The Dispatch.

